# Documentation only. The scaffold uses per-app .env files; see each .env.schema.
# Copy values into apps/server/.env and apps/web/.env as documented; never commit credentials.
# Required by current scaffold:
NODE_ENV=development
CORS_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:3001
DATABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SERVER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000

# Planned integrations: names and wiring are not yet implemented or vendor-verified.
# Set these only when their respective integrations are implemented.
# Neon managed Better Auth: service URL, client/public identifier, and server auth configuration.
# Cloudflare R2: account endpoint, bucket names, scoped access key ID and secret access key.
# Rivet: private control-plane endpoint and scoped server-only credentials.
# AgentMail: API key, inbox ID, and webhook verification details.
# Model and embeddings: provider, model identifiers, and server-only credentials or supported sign-in.
# Maps: style and tile URLs and any provider-issued browser-restricted token.
# Crawler, booking and payment provider credentials: optional according to enabled capabilities.

# The following names are a proposed inventory, not currently loaded by this scaffold.
